{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SytRowSuperstandard","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SytRowSuperstandard","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.StandardYoungTableau","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.Interval.Finset.Nat"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instNonemptyStandardYoungTableau","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instNonemptyStandardYoungTableau","kind":"instance","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L208-L212","doc":"**`StandardYoungTableau μ` is nonempty (sorry-free).** The base-tableau existence brick the\nOkounkov–Vershik exchange argument (`syt_all_connect_to_some`) needs: the row-superstandard tableau\nis an explicit witness. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandardStd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandardStd","kind":"def","line":202,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L202-L206","doc":"**The row-superstandard standard Young tableau** — the semistandard tableau above upgraded to a\n`StandardYoungTableau` by the `BijOn` onto `{1, …, |μ|}` (`MapsTo` + `InjOn` + `SurjOn`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandard_surjOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandard_surjOn","kind":"theorem","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L174-L200","doc":"**`SurjOn`**: the row-reading filling hits every label in `{1, …, |μ|}`. It is injective\n(`rowSuperstandard_injOn`) and maps the `|μ|` cells into `{1, …, |μ|}` (also `|μ|` elements), so it\nis onto by counting (`Finset.surjOn_of_injOn_of_card_le`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandard_injOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandard_injOn","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L150-L172","doc":"**`InjOn`**: distinct cells get distinct row-reading labels. If the labels agree, the rows must\nagree (a later row's first label already exceeds any earlier row's last label, by\n`rowPrefix_mono` + `j < rowLen`), and then the columns agree by cancellation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandard_mapsTo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandard_mapsTo","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L136-L148","doc":"**`MapsTo`**: the row-reading filling sends each cell into `{1, …, |μ|}`. Upper bound from\n`rowPrefix_succ_le_card` (`j + 1 ≤ rowLen i`, then `rowPrefix (i+1) ≤ |μ|`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandardSsyt_entry_of_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandardSsyt_entry_of_mem","kind":"theorem","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L130-L134","doc":"The row-superstandard entry on a cell `(i, j) ∈ μ` is `rowPrefix μ i + j + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix_succ_le_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix_succ_le_card","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L120-L128","doc":"The label offset up to and including row `i` is at most the total cell count, whenever row `i`\ncontains a cell (so `i < colLen 0`). This is the upper bound the `BijOn`'s `MapsTo` needs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.card_eq_sum_rowLen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.card_eq_sum_rowLen","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L114-L118","doc":"**`|μ| = ∑_{i < colLen 0} rowLen i`** — the total cell count as the sum of row lengths. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rows_disjoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rows_disjoint","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L108-L112","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.cells_eq_biUnion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.cells_eq_biUnion","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L96-L106","doc":"The cells of `μ` are the union of its (finitely many, indexed by `i < colLen 0`) rows;\ndistinct rows are disjoint (different first coordinate). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandardSsyt_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandardSsyt_apply","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L91-L92","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandardSsyt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandardSsyt","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L71-L89","doc":"**The row-superstandard semistandard Young tableau of shape `μ` (sorry-free).** Rows increase\n(weakly) because the position `j` grows; columns increase *strictly* because the row-prefix offset\nstrictly increases with the row index (`rowPrefix_strictMono_of_mem`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandardEntry","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowSuperstandardEntry","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L67-L69","doc":"The row-reading entry: `rowPrefix μ i + j + 1` on cells of `μ`, `0` off the diagram. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix_strictMono_of_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix_strictMono_of_mem","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L54-L65","doc":"If row `i2` is nonempty (some `(i2, j) ∈ μ`) then any earlier row `i1 ≤ i2` is strictly longer\nthan the prefix gap allows: `rowPrefix μ i1 < rowPrefix μ i2` whenever `i1 < i2` and row `i1`\ncontains a cell. Here we get positivity of `rowLen i1` from `rowLen_anti`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix_mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix_mono","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L47-L52","doc":"`rowPrefix` is monotone in the row index (a sum of the nonnegative row lengths over a larger\ninitial range). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix_succ","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L44-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix_zero","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.rowPrefix","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytRowSuperstandard.lean#L37-L40","doc":"`rowPrefix μ i` = number of cells in the rows strictly above row `i`\n(`∑_{i' < i} μ.rowLen i'`). This is the label offset of the first cell of row `i` in the\nrow-reading order. ","signatureChunk":0}]}